    83	        generation_constraints: Optional organizer-defined constraints on
    84	            which generation parameters submissions can set and their valid
    85	            ranges. If ``None``, no restrictions on generation params.
    86	        code_executor: Optional sandboxed code executor for running agent skills.
    87	        script_timeout: Timeout for skill script execution in seconds.
    88	        skill_registry: Optional registry of pre-approved skills.
    89	        adapter_manifest: Optional manifest of discovered adapters. If ``None``,
    90	            adapters are automatically discovered from the submission directory.
    91	        adapter_resolver_fn: Optional callable to resolve custom model representations
    92	            when an agent specifies both a base model and an adapter.
    93	        agent_factory: Optional factory registry of agent classes and constructors
    94	            for dependency injection. If ``None``, uses the module's resolved classes.
    95	
    96	    Returns:
    97	        The compiled root ADK agent, ready to run.
    98	
    99	    Raises:
   100	        SubmissionValidationError: If the submission fails validation, including
   101	            generation parameter constraint violations, missing skill directories,
   102	            invalid skill loading, or specifying an adapter without a base model.
   103	        SubmissionSchemaError: If the agent configuration or any referenced
