     3	- Budgets via eval_config.yaml `evaluation:` {timeout_seconds,max_tool_calls,max_time_minutes,max_turns}. Defaults 60 min / 100 calls(inference.py) / 500 turns. Setup time is NOT counted in the agent budget, but the 12h total includes it.
     4	- Compaction: interval 15, token_threshold 14336, retention 5. Caching min_tokens 2048.
     5	- Nudges: max 3 consecutive; non-empty source diff is graded even without submit_patch (git add -N . + git diff vs _swegemma_baseline; test/config files stripped).
     6	- Phase 2: fresh container, agent patch (4-pass apply), reset tests, apply test_patch, pytest exit 0; 300s timeout.
     7	- Gen config: thinking_budget 0..32768 (default 4096); max_output_tokens <=32768 (default 16384). With LoRA omit thinking_level; use include_thoughts + thinking_budget.
     8	- vLLM scorer: TP=4, gpu_mem_util 0.90, max_model_len 32768, gemma4 tool/reasoning parsers; LoRA: max_lora_rank from adapters.
     9	- Limits: <3GiB unpacked; ext whitelist yaml/yml/md/txt/py/json/safetensors.
    10	- Local CLI: `swegemma eval --tasks --snapshots-dir --submission-dir --results-dir --sandbox docker|subprocess --concurrency N`.
