codex
`.pre-commit-config.yaml` survives the harness filter, so a config-only patch can have `patch_size > 0`. I also found that the timing runner hardcodes compaction settings, while the local eval runner accepts broader YAML settings. A local-only trimming or compaction change could therefore give misleading results.
