     6	- Phase 2: fresh container, agent patch (4-pass apply), reset tests, apply test_patch, pytest exit 0; 300s timeout.
     7	- Gen config: thinking_budget 0..32768 (default 4096); max_output_tokens <=32768 (default 16384). With LoRA omit thinking_level; use include_thoughts + thinking_budget.
     8	- vLLM scorer: TP=4, gpu_mem_util 0.90, max_model_len 32768, gemma4 tool/reasoning parsers; LoRA: max_lora_rank from adapters.
